ight of 2. The second bar, at index 1, has a base height of 3 (light gray) =
and an additional height of 3 (orange hatched pattern), totaling 6. The thi=
rd bar, at index 2, has a height of 3. The fourth bar, at index 3, has a ba=
se height of 3 (light gray) and an additional height of 5 (orange hatched p=
attern), totaling 8. A horizontal orange line is drawn at height 3, labeled=
 'H =3D 3'.  Braces in light blue indicate the additional height above this=
